Title: Breakpoint Detection Error
Description: Functions for calculating the breakpoint detection error,
 <doi:10.48550/arXiv.1509.00368>
 which quantifies the number of false positive and false
 negative breakpoint detections when the latent breakpoint
 positions are known.
Suggests: jointseg, ggplot2 (>= 2.0), directlabels, tikzDevice, flsa